        "reason": "Query uses fetchAll() which loads all results into memory. Should use for-await-of over the query iterator or byPage() for proper pagination."
      },
      {
        "name": "LRO Pattern (beginXxx + pollUntilDone)",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "No long-running operations in Cosmos DB CRUD. All operations are immediate request-response. Criterion is not applicable and correctly handled."
